# Phase 133.1, F5 from the 2026-11-07 night: at 01:21 a good lock ended
# when the box went 3840 -> 1280 -> 640 -> 3840. The guider must hold its
# rates through a change of frame, re-reference, and keep the lock.
name    Guide: a box change while locked
timeout 360

env     RADUK_EMU_NEXSTAR=1
profile star.ini focuser position=168000

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Guide: a box
wait   3
goto   Kochab
expect 120 SEARCHING
wait   3
press  PLANET LOCK
expect 150 Acquisition: Locked
wait   5
press  1280
expect 10  [GUIDE] the frame changed
wait   2
press  640
wait   2
press  FULL
expect 10  [GUIDE] the frame changed
absent 25  Guiding abandoned
absent 1   hand control tracking restored
shot   after-format
